he best game possible!","path":"/game/17601705136-tycoon-rng","slug":"17601705136-tycoon-rng","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c1e785001491ca1c0ca0d9924b1ba85aea357ef7662bd4e6cb51fb76a0e938b2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-86b08d56d32c64abac194d4d04bcf53b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":40774083,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-15T16:53:57.087Z","creator":{"name":"Tycoon RNG 99","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":17,"freeCount":17,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14028946967,"name":"📉 Cart ride to save canny cat [PONZI SCHEMES!]","desc":"a remake for crtscc is in the works, stay tuned\n\nCore mechanics inspired by \"Cart ride around a 75kw diesel generator\". it should be in similar experiences go check it out too\n\nThe evil 🐈‍⬛ uncanny cats have kidnapped 🐈 canny cat and put him at the end of a perilous cart ride. Grab a cart and go save your kitty!\n\nControls/Tips:\n\nCTRL to shiftlock\nLMB or DOUBLE TAP to pick up unanchored part (such as a cart)\nSHIFT + WASDQE or ROTATE BUTTON + JOYSTICK to rotate currently held part\n\nTo start the game, pick up a cart and place it on the rails, then click the green button to start the cart. Make sure to look out for traps along the way! \nRemember that if your cart derails, you can jump out and drag it back into place. \n\nBuilding and electrical signals in this game can be confusing at first. Just remember that only parts which are glued together will transfer signals, and don't be afraid to ask experienced players for help. \n\nHave fun! 💥💥💥","path":"/game/14028946967-cart-ride-to-save-canny-cat","slug":"14028946967-cart-ride-to-save-canny-cat","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/731d06c28a16051d8aa224abd7738767121bc30c75a993c20c788fe41eb033b9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ab9a30c5928bcf53b5e9033807f78701/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":4,"visitor":1664056,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-22T04:04:25.637Z","creator":{"name":"Aceta